s_solution\": false,\r\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/355/10\",\r\n      \"text\": \"A-OPS安装以后， 智能定位----> 工作流   里面的 应用不能新增新应用？\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"user_name\": \"小喽啰\",\r\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\r\n      \"is_solution\": false,\r\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/355/11\",\r\n      \"text\": \"grafana仓库地址是不是修改了？部署脚本拉docker镜像失败了,貌似名字加了架构后缀x86之类的。\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"user_name\": \"Vchanger\",\r\n      \"topic_closed\": null,\r\n      \"is_solution\": false,\r\n      \"post_url\": \"/t/topic/355/12\",\r\n      \"text\": \"content: 部署脚本已更新并迁移至正式仓，可以参照最新的部署指导进行部署：gala-docs: Handbook and requirements documentation\\nlinks: https://gitee.com/openeuler/gala-docs#gala-ops%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}"}
